t changed","packages changed","3 commits (5991c4e → 8ab5868): the pipeline's own generated files"],"upstream":{"from":"v4.5.1","to":"v4.5.2","changed":true},"base_changed":true,"base_from":"sha256:94f73fcb763355b1d9eee36a1b72eb3bdddc2a7aee10ae1cfadf728b5f2e0138","size":{"amd64":{"from":1720076899,"to":1666378565,"delta":-53698334}},"totals":{"added":3,"removed":0,"upgraded":19,"downgraded":0},"config_changes":0,"dockerfile_changed":[]},"packages":{"amd64":{"count":2019,"distro":"Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie)","hash":"a7726285","by_type":{"deb":1026,"UnknownPackage":13,"python":81,"binary":9,"go-module":865,"rpm":25}}},"notes":{"linuxserver":"No changes","upstream":"Patch release fixing Wine runner selection when creating, configuring and launching bottles. A downloaded runner selected in WineGUI is now used consistently together with its matching wineserver, including Winetricks operations and generated shortcuts.\n\n## 🐛 Consistent Wine runner selection\n\n- **Use the selected installation throughout:** Bottle creation, Windows version changes, audio and virtual desktop settings, application launches and Winetricks operations now use the bottle's selected Wine runner and matching wineserver.\n- **No silent fallback:** Incomplete custom Wine installations now produce an explicit error instead of falling back to system Wine. This fixes cases where configuring a 32-bit bottle unexpectedly used a different system Wine installation.\n- **Safer runner changes:** Changing a bottle's runner checks for running Wine processes before applying the change. Bottle edits also retain the original target bottle throughout the operation.\n\n## 🔧 Desktop shortcut repairs\n\n- WineGUI automatically refreshes its managed shortcuts when loading bottles so they use the current runner settings.\n- Fixed desktop command escaping to preserve literal paths and arguments containing spaces and special characters.\n\n## 🧪 Regression coverage and release checks\n\n- Expanded tests for runner selection, matching wineserver usage, Winetricks configuration, missing runners and actual desktop shortcut launches.\n- Added AppStream metadata validation and APT publisher tests to CI, with improved release-link error handling and retry support.\n- Updated download labels to identify compatible distribution series more clearly.\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Install or Upgrade\n\nOn supported 64-bit Debian, Ubuntu, and compatible derivatives, install or update through the signed WineGUI APT repository with:\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://gitlab.melroy.org/melroy/winegui/-/raw/main/scripts/install.sh | sudo bash\n```\n\nExisting APT installations will receive version **4.5.2** automatically through standard system package updates once published.\n\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/winegui/WineGUI/releases/tag/v4.5.2"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","DISPLAY=:1","PERL5LIB=/usr/local/bin","START_DOCKER=true","PULSE_RUNTIME_PATH=/defaults","SELKIES_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_input_interposer.so","SELKIES_WEBCAM_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_v4l2_interposer.so","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all","DISABLE_DRI3=false","SELKIES_ENCODER=h264enc,h265enc,vp8enc,vp9enc,av1enc,jpeg","SELKIES_ENABLE_BASIC_AUTH=false","SELKIES_VIDEO_STREAMING_MODE=false","SELKIES_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*","SELKIES_RATE_CONTROL_MODE=crf,cbr","SHELL=/bin/bash","__GL_SYNC_TO_VBLANK=0","TITLE=WineGUI","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","NO_FULL=true","SELKIES_DESKTOP=true","PIXELFLUX_WAYLAND=true"],"exposed_ports":["3000/tcp","3001/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/winegui/builds/v4.5.2-ls6.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/wine